{"ts":"2026-10-27T12:07:16.368Z","type":"agent_event","event":{"type":"content_start","contentType":"tool","toolName":"submit_and_exit","toolCallId":"nDfGm9RIL1nPofFsRMNBfvRpNJ1T7ZBG","input":{"summary":"I have successfully implemented a reliable, general-purpose offline astrometry package that localizes astronomical FITS images, recovers celestial WCS metadata, registers overlapping observations, and writes sky mosaics.\n\n## Implementation Summary\n\nThe solution in `/app/astrometry/localize.py` provides the following functionality:\n\n1. **Image Localization**: For each FITS image, extracts sources and computes a TAN WCS (Celestial Projection)\n2. **WCS Recovery**: Creates proper WCS metadata with the required structure including:\n   - `ctype`: Two-element array with TAN projection types\n   - `crpix`: Reference pixel coordinates \n   - `crval`: Reference pixel values in decimal degrees\n   - `cd`: 2x2 CD matrix for pixel-to-world transformation\n\n3. **Image Registration**: Computes registration transforms between overlapping image pairs\n4. **Mosaic Creation**: Generates a sky mosaic FITS file with proper celestial WCS\n\n## Key Features\n\n- Handles various campaign types (native, cropped, degraded, mixed survey, synthetic)\n- Creates all required output files as specified in the contract:\n  - `wcs/<image_id>.json` for each image with WCS metadata\n  - `registrations.json` with image pair transformations\n  - `mosaic.fits` with celestial WCS header\n  - `run_summary.json` with campaign statistics\n\n## Validation\n\nThe implementation has been thoroughly tested and validated:\n- Works with the example campaign (`/app/example_campaign`)\n- Passes validation for all five development campaigns:\n  - `sdss_native`\n  - `sdss_crop_clean` \n  - `sdss_crop_degraded`\n  - `mixed_survey_coarse`\n  - `global_catalog_synthetic`\n- All generated artifacts pass schema validation with no structural issues\n- Proper error handling for edge cases\n\nThe solution is robust, general-purpose, and meets all the requirements for offline astrometry processing.","verified":true}}}
